{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09518","headline":"清明 · 孙昌胤","name":"清明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清明暮春里，怅望北山陲。\n燧火开新焰，桐花发故枝。\n沈冥慙岁物，欢宴阻朋知。\n不及林间鸟，迁乔并羽仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙昌胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}